    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This three-bedroom detached bungalow presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a renovation project in a highly convenient location close to Mullingar town centre. Set on a private site with a large rear garden, detached garage and ample parking, the property offers endless potential for buyers looking to modernise and create a family home to their own specification.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall with timber flooring leading to a spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area featuring timber flooring, a bay window, solid fuel stove and tiled kitchen area with side access. There are three bedrooms, two of which are double rooms, all benefiting from timber or laminate flooring, while the main bedroom enjoys fitted wardrobes and a bay window. A family bathroom completes the accommodation and features a bath, WC, wash hand basin and wall and floor tiling.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a large private rear garden with patio area, decking and a detached garage/shed offering excellent storage or workshop potential. The driveway provides ample off-street parking.\n\nIdeally located on the Ballynacarrigy Road, the property is within walking distance of Mullingar town centre, local schools and the Midland Regional Hospital. The nearby link road provides easy access to the N4 and excellent connectivity to Dublin and surrounding towns.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the potential this property has to offer.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall 2.05m x 4.31m (6'9\" x 14'2\"):\nTimber flooring.\n\nLiving Area/Dining/Kitchen\n3m x 8.02m (9'10\" x 26'4\") &\n3.7m x 4.46m (12'2\" x 14'8\"):\nOpen plan area with timber flooring, bay window, solid fuel free standing stove, tiled floor in kitchen area, side access.\n\nBathroom 2.66m x 1.88m (8'9\" x 6'2\"):\nTiled floor and walls, bath, WC, wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom One 2.55m x 2.74m (8'4\" x 9'):\nTimber flooring, rear aspect, single room.\n\nBedroom Two 3.66m x 3.01m (12' x 9'11\"):\nLaminate flooring, double room, rear aspect.\n\nBedroom Three 4.48m x 3.63m (14'8\" x 11'11\"):\nTimber flooring, double room, front aspect, fitted wardrobes, bay window.\n\nSpecial Features & Services\n• Three-bedroom detached bungalow\n• Private site with large rear garden\n• Ideal renovation project\n• Detached garage/workshop to rear\n• Patio and decking area\n• Ample off-street parking\n• Spacious open-plan living accommodation\n• Solid fuel stove\n• Walking distance to Mullingar town centre\n• Close to Midland Regional Hospital\n• Close to primary and secondary schools\n• Convenient Ballynacarrigy Road location\n• Easy access to the Link Road and N4\n• Excellent commuter location\n• Endless potential to modernise and extend\n• Ideal family home opportunity"
      },
